hub rung-2 explanation: <div class="explain" hidden><p>\((1.1)^4 + (0.9)^4 - 2 = 0.1202\), and dividing by \(h^2 = 0.01\) gives 12.02. The rung 2 completion problem asks for this second difference, which Lesson 13 builds from the expansions of \(f(x + h)\) and \(f(x - h)\).
